Subject: {{#if isManual}}{{{hostName}}} asks you to update {{#if isOrganization}}{{{collective.name}}}'s{{else}}your{{/if}} Open Collective profile{{else}}{{#if isReminder}}Reminder: {{else}}Action required: {{/if}}complete the information on {{#if isOrganization}}{{{collective.name}}}'s{{else}}your{{/if}} Open Collective profile{{/if}}

{{> header}}

{{#if recipientName}}
<p>Hi {{recipientName}},</p>
{{else}}
<p>Hi,</p>
{{/if}}

{{#if isManual}}
<p>
  <strong>{{hostName}}</strong>, a fiscal host on Open Collective, asks you to add or correct the following
  information on {{#if isOrganization}}<strong>{{collective.name}}</strong>'s{{else}}your{{/if}} profile to meet their
  legal and compliance requirements:
</p>

<ul>
  {{#each items}}
  <li>{{this}}</li>
  {{/each}}
</ul>

{{#if message}}
<p>Message from {{hostName}}:</p>
<blockquote style="margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 8px 16px; border-left: 4px solid #dcdcdc; white-space: pre-line;">{{message}}</blockquote>
{{/if}}

<p>
  The button below will take you to {{#if isOrganization}}{{collective.name}}'s{{else}}your{{/if}} profile settings, where
  you can update this information.
</p>
{{else}}
<p>
  {{#if isReminder}}We recently asked you to complete your profile, and some information is still missing. {{/if}}
  {{#if isOrganization}}
  Thank you for contributing on Open Collective on behalf of <strong>{{collective.name}}</strong>.
  {{else}}
  Thank you for contributing on Open Collective.
  {{/if}}
  Based on the amounts contributed, the following fiscal {{#if hasSeveralHosts}}hosts need{{else}}host needs{{/if}}
  some information to meet their legal and compliance requirements:
</p>

<ul>
  {{#each hosts}}
  <li><strong>{{name}}</strong>: {{fieldsLabel}}</li>
  {{/each}}
</ul>

<p>
  The button below will take you to {{#if isOrganization}}{{collective.name}}'s{{else}}your{{/if}} profile settings, where
  you can add this information. It will also be required for your next contributions to {{#if hasSeveralHosts}}these
  hosts{{else}}this host{{/if}}.
</p>
{{/if}}

<div style="text-align: center; margin: 32px 0;">
  <a class="btn blue" href="{{config.host.website}}/dashboard/{{#if isOrganization}}{{collective.slug}}{{else}}me{{/if}}/info">
    {{#if isManual}}Update{{else}}Complete{{/if}} {{#if isOrganization}}the{{else}}my{{/if}} profile
  </a>
</div>

<p>
  If you have any questions, please <a href="{{config.host.website}}/contact">contact us</a>.
</p>

{{> footer}}
